        {
          "segment_id": "title",
          "type": "title",
          "source_text": "锤菜",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-30-hammering-vegetables_title_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "小岩石巨人为什么要用阿沅的刀才能打？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-30-hammering-vegetables_dialogue_001_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "有些刀是用来切的，有的刀是用来砸的。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-30-hammering-vegetables_dialogue_002_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "就像锤子和菜刀，你总不能用锤子来切菜吧！",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-30-hammering-vegetables_dialogue_003_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "这就是“锤菜”了。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-30-hammering-vegetables_dialogue_004_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "以前我遇到小岩石巨人都是躲着走的，因为我的武器都打不了它。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-30-hammering-vegetables_dialogue_005_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "后面才看到你把它举起来砸死。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-30-hammering-vegetables_dialogue_006_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "006",
